1
00:01:46,448 --> 00:01:48,368
Climbing is tiring!

2
00:01:48,768 --> 00:01:52,304
My shoes are all wet and dirty too.

3
00:01:53,504 --> 00:01:57,200
There are many other tourists at this rest area,

4
00:01:57,376 --> 00:02:00,048
but they don’t seem tired at all.

5
00:02:00,752 --> 00:02:03,952
Instead, they’re talking and laughing!

6
00:02:05,056 --> 00:02:08,736
My sister Helen is also in high spirits

7
00:02:16,176 --> 00:02:18,416
We’re here at Bright Peak.

8
00:02:19,008 --> 00:02:22,544
Mount Huangshan is beautiful in the sunlight.

9
00:02:23,552 --> 00:02:25,328
I’m tired and hungry,

10
00:02:25,584 --> 00:02:28,704
but it feels good to be at the top!

